# Rust build output
/target/
**/target/

# Dioxus and frontend build output
**/dist/
**/.dioxus/

# Local configuration and secrets (examples stay tracked)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Local tooling and coverage
.direnv/
.envrc
coverage/
*.profraw
lcov.info

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# Understand anything
.ua

# Playwright run artifacts when the suite is invoked from the repo root
# (tests/playwright/.gitignore already covers the in-directory case).
test-results/

# Generated shadcn-style served registry tree (`cargo xtask registry
# build`): index.json + one content-bearing document per item. Never
# committed -- inlining every registry item's Rust source as escaped JSON
# strings would make every component-source diff unreadable and double
# review noise. Regenerated fresh wherever the registry is actually served.
# The CLI's own offline-fallback payload at
# packages/adico-cli/embedded/registry.json is the one generated registry
# artifact that IS committed (see docs/architecture.md).
/registry/generated/
